/**
 * Synthetic demo cases. All patients are fictional. No real personal or health
 * information.
 *
 * The prewritten results are ILLUSTRATIVE ONLY. They demonstrate the dashboard
 * and varied output shapes. They are not generated by live Claude, not clinically
 * reviewed, not validated diagnoses, and not known clinical negatives. They are
 * not expected answers for live-model testing.
 */
